I wish you all a happy new 2025 year!

And I also propose you a new Galette release, 1.1.5, which brings some fix and improvements:

- Fixes for PHP 8.4 compatibility
- Members cannot access their invoices/receipts
- Fatal error adding contribution when no type is present
- Fix few typehint issues
- Mass add/remove members from groups
- Use previous begin of membership date for new contributions
- Update translations in various languages, add new Tamil lang

